===A5_S1_D1===
Narrator: Hours have flown by since you busied yourself with the humans’ artifact collection. Amelia has wandered off elsewhere, claiming she had something to attend to.
Narrator: From diary entries like the one you found to trinkets… it’s amazing how much has been found and maintained.
Noelle: (Now for this box I’ve been hearing about.) #portrait:NoelleSmallSmile
Narrator: Indeed it is made of metal, but you recognize the way the key opening and indents on the sides are shaped. 
Narrator: …This style of box is one of the first things your mother taught you about.
Narrator: They’re used by high-ranking elders on Dusk to keep heirlooms and wills.
Noelle: (Which means that one of our ancestors was definitely…!) #portrait:NoelleShocked
Narrator: <i>Clack!</i>
Narrator: The box pops open. Your heart skips a beat.
Cillian: This is… #portrait:Cillian
Noelle: A pendant from the Tempest clan. #portrait:NoelleShocked
Narrator: Your mind races. Could it be true then, that Noah is—?
Cillian: There’s more. #portrait:Cillian
Narrator: Cillian sorts through the other items in the box. A compass that no longer works, a couple of entries in two different fonts.
Cillian: This is Elio and Noah’s penmanship. #portrait:Cillian
Noelle: So they locked away their keepsakes together? #portrait:NoelleWhat
Cillian: It’s not the most surprising. Regardless of what one thinks the <i>nature</i> of their relationship was, there was no doubt they were sworn partners. #portrait:Cillian
Noelle: …On my island, we use these kinds of locks for the heads of important families. #portrait:NoelleSkeptical
Narrator: You gulp, unsure of how Cillian might take this.
Noelle: And the engraving is the same as my clan’s. #portrait:NoelleUm
Narrator: You can almost hear the cogs turning in Cillian’s head.
Cillian: …It is probably best that you do not disclose your ties to this, moving forward. #portrait:Cillian
Cillian: We cannot be sure whether the pendant is Noah’s or Elio’s — but what’s important is that some may still hold ill-will towards those figures. So I will need some time to think before reporting what this box is about. #portrait:Cillian
Narrator: Cillian does his best to quirk a smile.
Cillian: Regardless of politics, you <i>have</i> helped us greatly by opening this. #portrait:Cillian
Cillian: If your goal is still to fix up your boat, you may try approaching our head weaver, Rowan, for fabric to make a sail. #portrait:Cillian
Cillian: Tell him I sent you. Clara can show you the way. #portrait:Cillian
->DONE